* Pricing yield collateral on Morpho
** Shared setting
*** One immutable oracle per market
*** LIF 4.38 % at 86 % LLTV, 2.62 % at 91.5 %
*** MorphoChainlinkOracleV2, no USDC/USD quote
** Huma PST
*** PayFi receipt, 7-day revolving loans
*** Chainlink exchange rate (redemption value)
*** CCIP burn-and-mint to Ethereum
*** Blind to defaults, runs, bridge mints
*** Fails late: bad debt for lenders
** Ojo PT feed
*** min(Pendle 15-min TWAP, linear discount)
*** Ceiling, no floor
*** Staleness check always passes
*** Fails early: false liquidations
** 25 Aug 2026 PT-reUSD
*** YT buys push TWAP down 277 bps
*** 33 liquidations, about 36.1M repaid
*** 2.62 % bonus paid by borrowers, no bad debt
** What to watch
*** Issuer buffer, queue, DEX discount
*** Bridge mints and admins
*** Oracle floor, window, borrow gap
